{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o066d","title":"刘备立吴皇后刘禅皇太子","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o066d-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"刘备立吴氏为皇后、刘禅为皇太子。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o066d-q"]},{"id":"houzhu-a-1d2ccd1c4723","label":"《后主传》正文","text":"及即尊号，册曰〖3〗：“惟章武元年五月辛巳〖4〗，皇帝若曰〖5〗：太子禅，朕遭汉运艰难，贼臣篡盗；社稷无主，格人群正〖6〗；以天明命，朕继大统〖7〗。今以禅为皇太子，以承宗庙，祗肃社稷〖8〗。使使持节、丞相亮，授印绶；敬听师傅，行一物而三善皆得焉〖9〗，可不勉与〖10〗！”﹝一﹞","evidence":["houzhu-q-O002"]},{"id":"erfei-a-3a0e3a121e88bf2b4adc","label":"正文","text":"刘备策立吴氏为皇后","evidence":["erfei-q-512baec489e7c40297d3","erfei-q2-ae736c6de8ae8b2111d7"]}],"participants":[{"person":"liu-bei","role":"册立","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o066d-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0111","role":"立为皇后","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o066d-q"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0112","role":"立为皇太子","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o066d-q"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"授印绶者","evidence":["houzhu-q-O002"]},{"person":"erfei-p0009","role":"被策立为皇后","evidence":["erfei-q-512baec489e7c40297d3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":221,"label":"章武元年五月","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y221","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o065","basis":"章武元年五月"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o066d-q","xianzhu-q-o065","xianzhu-q-b-7396ee3085c96d5be06c"]},"source_order":[32,400,"O066d"],"order":6605}],"persons":[{"id":"erfei-p0009","name":"吴氏（刘备穆皇后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0111","name":"吴氏（刘备皇后）","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"xianzhu-p0112","name":"刘禅","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"zhuge-liang","name":"诸葛亮","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"erfei-q-512baec489e7c40297d3","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-b32e4a84f604af4b02d4","layer":"original","quote":"章武元年夏五月，策曰","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":10},{"id":"erfei-q2-ae736c6de8ae8b2111d7","section":"chapter-034","block":"b-b32e4a84f604af4b02d4","layer":"original","quote":"章武元年夏五月，策曰：“朕承天命，奉至尊〖6〗，临万国。今以后为皇后，遣使持节、丞相亮授玺绶〖7〗；承宗庙，母天下〖8〗。皇后其敬之哉！”","section_title":"二主妃子传第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0074.xhtml","index":34,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":69},{"id":"houzhu-q-O002","section":"chapter-033","block":"b-7c043f25cb0b51f20adc","layer":"original","quote":"及即尊号，册曰〖3〗：“惟章武元年五月辛巳〖4〗，皇帝若曰〖5〗：太子禅，朕遭汉运艰难，贼臣篡盗；社稷无主，格人群正〖6〗；以天明命，朕继大统〖7〗。今以禅为皇太子，以承宗庙，祗肃社稷〖8〗。使使持节、丞相亮，授印绶；敬听师傅，行一物而三善皆得焉〖9〗，可不勉与〖10〗！”﹝一﹞","section_title":"后主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0072.xhtml","index":2,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":140},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o066d-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-9899314a2556743b9f4b","layer":"original","quote":"五月，立皇后吴氏〖2〗，子禅为皇太子。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":399,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":50,"end":69},{"id":"xianzhu-q-b-7396ee3085c96d5be06c","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-7396ee3085c96d5be06c","layer":"modern","quote":"〖22〗建安二十六年：公元 221 年。建安年号到二十四年为止。刘备不承认曹魏的年号，所以继续以建安年号记年。丙午：阴历初六日。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":380,"anchor":null},"note_id":"n-dce0e27ac9260548c4b5","start":0,"end":64},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o065","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-3ec28bd830861da89fc0","layer":"original","quote":"即皇帝位于成都武担之南〖21〗，﹝一﹞为文曰：“惟建安二十六年四月丙午〖22〗，皇帝〔臣〕备，敢用玄牡〖23〗，昭告皇天上帝、后土神祇：汉有天下，历数无疆。曩者王莽篡盗〖24〗，光武皇帝震怒致诛，社稷复存。今曹操阻兵安忍〖25〗，戮杀主后；滔天泯夏〖26〗，罔顾天显〖27〗。操子丕，载其凶逆〖28〗，窃居神器。群臣将士以为社稷坠废，备宜修之；嗣武二祖〖29〗，龚行天罚。备惟否德〖30〗，惧忝帝位〖31〗；询于庶民，外及蛮夷君长，佥曰：‘天命不可以不答，祖业不可以久替，四海不可以无主；率土式望〖32〗，在备一人。’备畏天明命，又惧汉阼将湮于地；谨择元日〖33〗，与百僚登坛，受皇帝玺绶；修燔瘗〖34〗，告类于大神〖35〗。惟神〔尚〕飨〖36〗！祚于汉家，永绥四海〖37〗！”﹝二﹞","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":357,"anchor":null},"note_id":null,"start":0,"end":342}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
